What I included
- A README with setup instructions
- Docker Compose for local dev (PHP-FPM, Nginx, MySQL)
- Minimal Laravel backend skeleton:
  - User & Profile models + migrations
  - API routes and controllers: Auth, Profile, Match (basic), Chat (simple message store)
  - Sanctum-based token auth (for API)
- Tiny React frontend:
  - Login, profile view, and a simple “discover” page calling the match endpoint

Next steps I can do for you
- Add the project to your GitHub repo (I can push these files if you confirm the repo owner and branch).
- Expand features: swipe deck, real-time messaging (WebSockets), mobile React Native app, subscription/billing, moderation dashboard.
- Add tests, CI (GitHub Actions), or production-ready Docker / helm manifests.

If you want me to push this into yoxyoxdur135-png/pulse, confirm and I will request the repository owner string (or confirm “yoxyoxdur135-png/pulse”) and push.

